README for asciidoc

REQUIREMENTS

    For the full functionality of a2x wrapper, install: libxslt(opt), lynx(contrib), fop(n/a), docbook-xsl(gnome) etc.
Install source-highlight(contrib) for embedded source highlighting inside asciidoc generated documents.
For further information refer to
http://www.methods.co.nz/asciidoc/a2x.1.html or a2x manpage

